  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Update to .NET 11 and Entity Framework Core 11\n- Add UseExceptionProcessor overload that accepts a custom IDbExceptionClassifier\n- Populate ConstraintName and ConstraintProperties for alternate key violations\n- Fix constraint details when one constraint name contains another (for example IX_Users and IX_Users_Name): the longest matching name is now used\n- EntityFrameworkCore.Exceptions.MySQL.Pomelo is discontinued. With Pomelo or other MySqlConnector-based providers, use UseExceptionProcessor(new MySqlConnectorExceptionClassifier()) from the DbExceptionClassifier.MySqlConnector package",
